o spends a lot of time with the Kirishimas, but it wasn't always this way. Shortly after their parents' deaths, Hayato tried to handle everything on his own, running home from university every day to be there when Gakuto came home from kindergarten. One day, he noticed Kirishima-san's grim looks.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-10-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/65jp4HP6Pxj1V7qQngcBbLPKrID.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/65jp4HP6Pxj1V7qQngcBbLPKrID.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/229612/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"4832211","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hayato is looking forward to his class reunion. But his former classmates complain about work and brag about their travels, while he only talks about his brothers. He feels left behind by life...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-10-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qRAWvkyHYS4eNTVX7oyHa3OICNi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qRAWvkyHYS4eNTVX7oyHa3OICNi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/229612/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"4832212","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Uta and Minato are best friends. One day, a classmate declares his love for Uta. The two arrange a date. How will Minato react?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-11-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ptoza3wTh0nAAdDm1n2EwSwcpVo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ptoza3wTh0nAAdDm1n2EwSwcpVo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/229612/season/1/episode/5"},{"i